               <title>Hydrofilm Transparrent Dressing</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>30 Sheets of Hydrofilm transparent sterile dressing that contains a transparent, semi-permeable polyurethane polyacrylate top layer and hypoallergenic, polyacrylate adhesive layer. The dressing is used to protect against secondary infection and against mechanical irritation of wounds in later stages of healing.</paragraph>
